==History==
2017
*The Royal Ghost was once available in the [[Tournament/Special Event Challenges|Royal Ghost Mirror Challenge]] which started on 22/12/2017. In this [[Tournament|challenge]], gameplay was similar to a regular [[Mirror]] Challenge, except that the players has the Royal Ghost in their [[Battle Decks|decks]]. If the player achieved 12 wins, they obtained the Royal Ghost early.
2018
*The Royal Ghost [[Cards|card]] was generally released on 4/1/2018.
*On 24/1/2018, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (24/1/2018)|Balance Update]], decreased the Royal Ghost's damage by 6%, increased his attack time interval to 1.8 seconds (from 1.7 seconds), increased his first attack time interval to 0.6 seconds (from 0.5 seconds), and increased the time required for turning invisible to 1.2 seconds (from 0.7 seconds). There was also an unannounced change to the Royal Ghost, an increase to his sight range to 5.5 tiles (from 5 tiles).
*On 25/4/2018, the [[Version History#Clan%20Wars%20Update%20(25/4/2018)|Clan Wars Update]], added the Royal Ghost to [[Touchdown]] Draft.
*On 4/6/2018, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (4/6/2018)|Balance Update]], increased the time required for turning invisible to 1.6 seconds (from 1.2 seconds).
*On 20/6/2018, the [[Version History#Summer%202018%20Update%20(20/6/2018)|Summer 2018 Update]], moved the [[Arenas|Arena]] to unlock the Royal Ghost from Hog Mountain to Royal Arena.
*On 5/9/2018, the [[Version History#September%202018%20Update%20(5/9/2018)|September 2018 Update]], changed it so that {{Rarity|Legendary}} cards start at Level 9 and end at Level 13 (from 1 to 5).
*On 5/11/2018, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (5/11/2018)|Balance Update]], decreased the Royal Ghost's hitpoints by 9%.
2019
*On 28/1/2019, the [[Version History#January%202019%20Update%20(28/1/2019)|January 2019 Update]], moved the Arena to unlock the Royal Ghost from Royal Arena to Spooky Town.
*On 2/9/2019, a [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (2/9/2019)|Balance Update]], increased the Royal Ghost's area radius to 1 tile (from 0.8 tiles).
*On 26/11/2019, the [[Version History#End%20of%20November%202019%20Update%20(26/11/2019)|End of November 2019 Update]], added a card render to the Royal Ghost's card info screen.
2020
*On 6/10/2020, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (6/10/2020)|Balance Update]], allowed the Royal Ghost to hover, meaning he can cross the river and will collide with air [[:Category:Troop Cards|troops]] instead of ground troops.
*On 3/11/2020, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (3/11/2020)|Balance Update]], changed the Royal Ghost's card render.
*On 18/11/2020, the [[Version History#Clan%20Wars%20Improvement%20Update%20(18/11/2020)|Clan Wars Improvement Update]], changed the hover mechanic. The Royal Ghost would no longer pass through [[:Category:Building Cards|buildings]], push back air troops, or bounce off the river when knocked back.
2021
*On 27/10/2021, the [[Version History#Champions%20Update%20(27/10/2021)|Champions Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 14 (from 13).
2022
*On 8/4/2022, a [[Version History#Maintenance Break (8/4/2022)|maintenance break]], fixed an issue where an invisible Royal Ghost was not receiving splash damage.
*On 7/6/2022, a [[Version History#Balance%20Changes%20(7/6/2022)|Balance Update]], increased the time required for turning invisible to 1.8 seconds (from 1.6 seconds).
2023
*On 19/6/2023, the [[Version History#Card%20Evolution%20Update%20(19/6/2023)|Card Evolution Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 15 (from 14).
2024
*On 2/10/2024, the [[Version History#Lucky Drops 2.0 Update (2/10/2024)|Lucky Drops 2.0 Update]], made it so that Royal Ghost would no longer be immune to [[Earthquake]] and [[Royal Giant/Evolution|Evolved Royal Giant]]'s recoil.
2025
*On 6/10/2025, the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (6/10/2025)|October 2025 Update]], added the Royal Ghost's Evolution
2026

* On 2/3/2026, a Balance Update, decreased the Royal Ghost's invisibility delay to 2 seconds (from 1.8 seconds).

