==Trivia ==
*The Royal Ghost may be inspired by the [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ghost_(Hamlet) ghost of Hamlet's father] from the theatrical play ''"[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hamlet Hamlet]"'' by [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/William_Shakespeare William Shakespeare].
*The Royal Ghost is 1 of 17 [[:Category:Troop Cards|troops]] that inspired a troop in Clash of Clans, the others being [[Spear Goblins]], [[Bomber]], [[Bats]], [[Skeleton Barrel]], [[Minion Horde]], [[Firecracker]], [[Battle Ram]], [[Ice Golem]], [[Zappies]], [[Baby Dragon]], [[Giant Skeleton]], [[Ram Rider]], [[Inferno Dragon]], [[Miner]], [[Ice Wizard]], and [[Night Witch]].
**Unlike [https://clashofclans.fandom.com/wiki/Royal_Ghost his counterpart in Clash of Clans], the Royal Ghost in Clash Royale is always invisible until he breaks stealth and can enter it again after some inactivity, deals medium amounts of area damage with moderate health, but never slows his targets.
*The Royal Ghost is 1 of 20 [[cards]] associated with nobility, with the others being [[Knight]], [[Royal Recruits]], [[Royal Giant]], [[Royal Delivery]], [[Tower Princess]], [[Royal Hogs]], [[Dark Prince]], [[Prince]], [[Raging Prince]], [[Mega Knight]], [[Princess]], [[Spirit Empress]], [[Super Knight]], [[Dagger Duchess]], [[Royal Chef]], [[Golden Knight]], [[Skeleton King]], [[Archer Queen]], and the [[Little Prince]].
*The Royal Ghost is one of the first troop cards to receive a card render, alongside the [[Archers]], Knight, [[Goblins]], Bomber, [[Skeletons]], [[Barbarians]], Bats, Royal Recruits, Skeleton Barrel, [[Rascals]], [[Musketeer]], [[Giant]], [[Valkyrie]], [[Wizard]], [[Flying Machine]], [[Hog Rider]], Royal Hogs, [[Dart Goblin]], Zappies, [[Elixir Golem]], Baby Dragon, [[Skeleton Army]], [[Witch]], [[P.E.K.K.A.|P.E.K.K.A]], Prince, [[Balloon]], Giant Skeleton, [[Goblin Giant]], [[Hunter]], [[Electro Dragon]], [[Wall Breakers]], [[Bowler]], [[Cannon Cart]], Mega Knight, Ram Rider, Miner, Ice Wizard, [[Magic Archer]], [[Bandit]], [[Lava Hound]], Night Witch, and [[Fisherman]].
*The Royal Ghost is 1 of 3 troops that can turn invisible and not distract other enemies, the others being [[Suspicious Bush]] and the [[Archer Queen]].
*The Royal Ghost has been featured in multiple [[Tournament/Special Event Challenges|special game modes]] outside of the card. More specifically:
**The Royal Ghost is 1 of 23 troops that has been featured in the [[Troop Rush]] game [[:Category:Modes|mode]], the others being Skeletons, [[Skeleton Dragons]], [[Fire Spirit]], Bats, [[Elite Barbarians]], Firecracker, Rascal Girls, Royal Hogs, [[Heal Spirit]], Elixir Golem, [[Guards]], Prince, Balloon, [[Golem]], Wall Breakers, Ram Rider, [[Sparky]], [[Phoenix]], Bandit, [[Lumberjack]], [[Santa Hog Rider]], and the [[Monk]].
**The Royal Ghost is 1 of 14 troops that has been featured with a [[Buff#Rage|Rage]] [[buff]], the others being [[Electro Spirit]], Giant, Zappies, Guards, Giant Skeleton, Goblin Giant, Electro Dragon, Wall Breakers, [[Electro Giant]], Mega Knight, Ram Rider, [[Electro Wizard]], and Sparky.
**The Royal Ghost is 1 of 10 troops that has been featured under the [[Ruler Ability#Special Delivery|Special Delivery]] [[Ruler Ability|ruler ability]], the others being Knight, Skeleton Barrel, [[Mini P.E.K.K.A.|Mini P.E.K.K.A]], Musketeer, Wizard, P.E.K.K.A, Giant Skeleton, Golem, and Sparky.
*The Royal Ghost, along with the [[Minions]], Bomber, Skeletons, Skeleton Dragons, [[Ice Spirit]], Mini P.E.K.K.A, [[Mega Minion]], Ice Golem, Dart Goblin, Elixir Golem, [[Goblin Cage|Goblin Brawler]], Guards, Baby Dragon, P.E.K.K.A, Giant Skeleton, Golem, Wall Breakers, Bowler, [[Executioner]], Mega Knight, [[Inferno Dragon]], and Lava Hound, are featured as a [https://squad-busters.fandom.com/wiki/Monsters monster] in [https://squad-busters.fandom.com/wiki/Squad_Busters_Wiki Squad Busters].
**He is the 1 of 2 troops that appears in a modifier in Squad Busters, the other being Ice Spirit.
*The Royal Ghost is confirmed to be both of the [[King's Tower|Kings]]' father. He is also confirmed to be a former King according to the Clash-A-Rama episode "[https://clasharama.fandom.com/wiki/%22Pork-tergeist%22 Pork-tergeist]".
*The Royal Ghost is the subject of certain cosmetics in the game. More specifically:
**The Royal Ghost is the subject of 4 [[Emotes]].
***The Royal Ghost Shadow Emote was originally going to appear in April of 2019, but did not make it to the game until the September of 2025.
**The Royal Ghost is the subject of a [[King's Tower|Tower Skin]].
*A [[Clone|cloned]] Royal Ghost does not fall from the sky when deployed.
*On 27/3/2023, a [[Training Camp|Trainer]] was added to the game called Boss Cheddar, and used a Level 18 Royal Ghost in their [[Battle Decks|deck]], despite the highest Level being Level 14 at the time. This Trainer was removed on 18/4/2023.
*In the [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FsOoUI57Dzw 5/11/2018 balance changes reveal video], the text on screen incorrectly states the Royal Ghost's 9% hitpoints decrease as a 6% hitpoints decrease.
*The Royal Ghost was originally going to appear in early 2017, with a invisibility mechanic that would dash to the enemy, and reveal himself along with a stun. However, the stun mechanic [https://youtu.be/9zfaXDCY0ZI?si=XUmeaFpHOsXKAVt1&t=1068 were dropped], and the dash mechanic lead to the creation of the Bandit. Ultimately, the Royal Ghost was added in one of Clash Royale's updates.

